<bg-layer />
<view class="chat-page">
  <nav-bar back="{{true}}" />
  <view class="chat-head">
    <view class="h1">安心</view>
    <view class="muted intro">
      我只回答已经审核过的知识，并把话题带到对应的功能页。我不做诊断，也不给分型。
    </view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view scroll-y class="thread" scroll-into-view="{{scrollTo}}" scroll-with-animation>
    <view wx:if="{{messages.length === 0}}" class="empty-thread">
      <view class="tiny">你可以点下面的问题，也可以自己输入。</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="key" id="m{{index}}">
      <view wx:if="{{item.role === 'user'}}" class="bubble user">{{item.text}}</view>
      <view wx:else class="bubble anxin">
        <view wx:for="{{item.paras}}" wx:for-item="para" wx:key="*this" class="para">{{para}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.sourceText}}" class="sources">依据：{{item.sourceText}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.boundary}}" class="boundary">{{item.boundary}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.actions.length}}" class="acts">
          <text
            wx:for="{{item.actions}}"
            wx:for-item="act"
            wx:key="url"
            class="act"
            bindtap="goAction"
            data-url="{{act.url}}"
          >{{act.label}} ›</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view id="bottom"></view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="suggest">
    <view
      wx:for="{{suggestions}}"
      wx:key="*this"
      class="suggest-chip"
      bindtap="askSuggestion"
      data-q="{{item}}"
    >{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="composer">
    <input
      class="composer-input"
      placeholder="问一个关于症状或课程的问题"
      value="{{draft}}"
      bindinput="onInput"
      bindconfirm="send"
      confirm-type="send"
    />
    <view class="composer-send" bindtap="send">发送</view>
  </view>
</view>
